{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/STEAMGIF_Possession_600x306.gif?t=1744894818\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your powers of possession bring inanimate objects to life! Use them to fight, run away or just <i><strong>look darn good</strong></i> whilst you soak up the chaos unfolding around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/STEAMGIF_Combat_600x306.gif?t=1744894818\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Polterguys is a spooky brawlfest where mischievous ghosts are being stalked by a deadly monster who wants to destroy them all! Chaotic? Yes! Competitive? You betcha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/STEAMGIF_Whirlwind_600x306.gif?t=1744894818\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sabotage</strong> and spite are your greatest allies! Use the monster as a <strong>portable death machine</strong> to destroy your opponents with <i>seemingly</i> harmless abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/STEAMGIF_Grenade_600x306.gif?t=1744894818\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong>tonnes of powerups and traps</strong> sprinkled about the levels to help you create carnage... the question is can you <strong>make it count</strong> with the monster breathing down your little gooey neck?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&quot;So... what's in the game <strong><i>RIGHT NOW!?&quot;</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're glad you asked! Here's what you get on day one:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 unique levels packed with physics based traps and toys!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 collectable costume possessions to discover and level up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daily and weekly challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weekly leader boards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Spooky Trail to travel along for progression!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loads of rewards: avatars, emotes, special effects, personalised podiums, and way more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Split-screen couch play for up to 4 players, who can also go online together and play as a party!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your own space called your 'haunt'... use candy that you collect to buy new addons for it in game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Explor-cist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1043520/6822eb890de4467e5aa590b809c02eb8676e2c72.jpg"},{"name":"Haunt Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1043520/6822eb890de4467e5aa590b809c02eb8676e2c72.jpg"},{"name":"Fridge Horror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1043520/4cfbc37986ee6f02486edeb9618694d857b65ac6.jpg"},{"name":"Misfit Toys","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1043520/6822eb890de4467e5aa590b809c02eb8676e2c72.jpg"},{"name":"Scaredy Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1043520/4cfbc37986ee6f02486edeb9618694d857b65ac6.jpg"},{"name":"Over 